{"version":1,"content":"<p>【密函曝光 😱】法國獨立調查媒體《Blast》近日披露獨家政府內部文件，指控法國總理 Sébastien Lecornu 在 10 月 24 日全法大規模示威爆發前夕，曾秘密發函要求國內四大主流電訊營運商做好準備，隨時依政府指令全面封鎖 TikTok、Instagram、Snapchat 及 X 等主流社交平台，但電訊商拒絕執行。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:37.264882+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:05.266697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:02.794667+00:00","content_hash":"4b41960f3530cc566097d5e3b13caac9bf461cc39ff6ec1843f03164479a6860","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}